# Title: Execution Of Script Located In Potentially Suspicious Directory
# ID: 30bcce26-51c5-49f2-99c8-7b59e3af36c7
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Joseliyo Sanchez, @Joseliyo_Jstnk
# Date: 2023-06-02
# Tags: attack.execution
# Description: Detects executions of scripts located in potentially suspicious locations such as "/tmp" via a shell such as "bash", "sh", etc.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process.command_line:* -c *) AND ((process.executable:*/bash OR process.executable:*/csh OR process.executable:*/dash OR process.executable:*/fish OR process.executable:*/ksh OR process.executable:*/sh OR process.executable:*/zsh)) AND (process.command_line:*/tmp/*))
